# Yojana-Setu – Implementation Plan

A voice-first, zero-typing AI assistant for rural Indian citizens to access government scheme information in any Indian language.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **AWS Account & Credentials**: The backend relies on AWS services (Transcribe, Bedrock, Kendra, Polly, S3, DynamoDB). You will need an AWS account with these services enabled and appropriate credentials configured. The Lambda functions will use environment variables — no keys are hardcoded.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Kendra Index**: Amazon Kendra requires a pre-provisioned index with government scheme documents ingested. This plan creates the Lambda code to query Kendra but does NOT provision the index itself (that requires uploading scheme PDFs and configuring data sources).

> [!WARNING]
> **Tailwind CSS**: Per your PRD, we will use Tailwind CSS v4 for the frontend. This overrides the default styling preference.

---

